      "y": 88,
      "width": 1200,
      "height": 25,
      "text": "State + graph orchestration across stages \u00b7 13 nodes (12 LLM + 1 deterministic) \u00b7 2 subgraphs \u00b7 checkpointed for resumability",
      "originalText": "State + graph orchestration across stages \u00b7 13 nodes (12 LLM + 1 deterministic) \u00b7 2 subgraphs \u00b7 checkpointed for resumability",
