    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "box_text_100014",
      "x": 1290,
      "y": 158,
      "width": 1080,
      "height": 1884,
      "text": "PipelineState  (TypedDict, flows through every node)\n\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\n\n  # \u2500\u2500 Identity (set by Stage 0) \u2500\u2500\n  persona_slug:           str            # e.g. 'avery_chen'\n  persona_name:           str            # e.g. 'Avery Chen'\n  prompt_text:            str            # verbatim user prompt\n  working_dir:            Path           # data/<slug>/\n\n  # \u2500\u2500 Window (set by Stage 0 from config) \u2500\u2500\n  window_start_date:      str            # ISO date \u2014 Day 1   (e.g. '2026-04-19')\n  window_end_date:        str            # ISO date \u2014 Day 35  (e.g. '2026-05-23')\n\n  # \u2500\u2500 Stage tracking (updated by every node) \u2500\u2500\n  completed_stages:       list[str]      # ['stage_00_spec', 'stage_01a_life_context', ...]\n  stage_outputs:          dict[str, list[str]]\n                                         # stage_id \u2192 list of file paths the agent wrote\n\n  # \u2500\u2500 Stage 7 cascade-specific \u2500\u2500\n  current_day:            int            # 1..35\n  last_completed_day:     int            # for mid-cascade resume\n\n  # \u2500\u2500 Stage 9 fan-out specific \u2500\u2500\n  completed_mornings:     list[int]      # [6, 7, 8, ...] subset of 6..35\n\n  # \u2500\u2500 Error handling \u2500\u2500\n  errors:                 list[dict]     # [{stage, message, retry_count}, ...]\n\n  # \u2500\u2500 Logging \u2500\u2500\n  llm_call_log_path:      Path           # graph/logs/llm_calls.jsonl\n  validation_log_path: Path  # internal/validation_log.jsonl\n    agent_turn_logs:        dict[str, Path]\n                                         # stage_id \u2192 per-stage turn log\n\n\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\n\nPersistence:  LangGraph SQLite checkpointer writes after every node\nLocation:     data/<slug>/.langgraph_checkpoint.db\n\nEffects:\n  \u2022 `--from-stage N`        skips to stage N\n  \u2022 `--resume`              picks up from last completed node\n  \u2022 mid-cascade death       Stage 7 re-enters at last_completed_day + 1\n  \u2022 re-run completed slug   no-op (every node sees its stage already complete)\n\nConditional routing notes:\n  \u2022 Every stage node has a 'retry' conditional out-edge. If `agent_runtime`\n    verification (after the agent terminates) finds expected output files\n    missing, retry once. Second failure appends to state.errors and either\n    skips downstream (non-blocking) or terminates the pipeline.\n  \u2022 Stage 0 is idempotent: if personas/<slug>.yaml already exists, the\n    node returns immediately marking the stage complete.\n  \u2022 Stages 8A, 8B, 9 are parallel-eligible \u2014 LangGraph fans them out\n    after Stage 7 completes; their results merge before END.",
      "originalText": "PipelineState  (TypedDict, flows through every node)\n\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\n\n  # \u2500\u2500 Identity (set by Stage 0) \u2500\u2500\n  persona_slug:           str            # e.g. 'avery_chen'\n  persona_name:           str            # e.g. 'Avery Chen'\n  prompt_text:            str            # verbatim user prompt\n  working_dir:            Path           # data/<slug>/\n\n  # \u2500\u2500 Window (set by Stage 0 from config) \u2500\u2500\n  window_start_date:      str            # ISO date \u2014 Day 1   (e.g. '2026-04-19')\n  window_end_date:        str            # ISO date \u2014 Day 35  (e.g. '2026-05-23')\n\n  # \u2500\u2500 Stage tracking (updated by every node) \u2500\u2500\n  completed_stages:       list[str]      # ['stage_00_spec', 'stage_01a_life_context', ...]\n  stage_outputs:          dict[str, list[str]]\n                                         # stage_id \u2192 list of file paths the agent wrote\n\n  # \u2500\u2500 Stage 7 cascade-specific \u2500\u2500\n  current_day:            int            # 1..35\n  last_completed_day:     int            # for mid-cascade resume\n\n  # \u2500\u2500 Stage 9 fan-out specific \u2500\u2500\n  completed_mornings:     list[int]      # [6, 7, 8, ...] subset of 6..35\n\n  # \u2500\u2500 Error handling \u2500\u2500\n  errors:                 list[dict]     # [{stage, message, retry_count}, ...]\n\n  # \u2500\u2500 Logging \u2500\u2500\n  llm_call_log_path:      Path           # graph/logs/llm_calls.jsonl\n  validation_log_path: Path  # internal/validation_log.jsonl\n    agent_turn_logs:        dict[str, Path]\n                                         # stage_id \u2192 per-stage turn log\n\n\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\n\nPersistence:  LangGraph SQLite checkpointer writes after every node\nLocation:     data/<slug>/.langgraph_checkpoint.db\n\nEffects:\n  \u2022 `--from-stage N`        skips to stage N\n  \u2022 `--resume`              picks up from last completed node\n  \u2022 mid-cascade death       Stage 7 re-enters at last_completed_day + 1\n  \u2022 re-run completed slug   no-op (every node sees its stage already complete)\n\nConditional routing notes:\n  \u2022 Every stage node has a 'retry' conditional out-edge. If `agent_runtime`\n    verification (after the agent terminates) finds expected output files\n    missing, retry once. Second failure appends to state.errors and either\n    skips downstream (non-blocking) or terminates the pipeline.\n  \u2022 Stage 0 is idempotent: if personas/<slug>.yaml already exists, the\n    node returns immediately marking the stage complete.\n  \u2022 Stages 8A, 8B, 9 are parallel-eligible \u2014 LangGraph fans them out\n    after Stage 7 completes; their results merge before END.",
