    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "text_stage9",
      "x": 210,
      "y": 1613,
      "width": 730,
      "height": 244,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "seed": 788874,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 594932,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "Stage 9 SUBGRAPH  \u00b7  Ideal Digest  (validation + assembly merged)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n9a Validation  (parallel-per-moment fan-out \u00b7 ~80\u2013150 LLM agents per persona)\n   For each declared moment with final lifecycle == DECLARED and target_morning \u2208 Days 6\u201335,\n   spawn ONE validation agent reading artifacts visible by morning M + calendar snapshot(M-1)\n   + daily_state(M-1) + character_sketch + judgment. Each agent emits exactly one of:\n   validation_pass \u00b7 validation_fail \u00b7 validation_correct \u2192 internal/validation_log.jsonl\n\n                         \u2193  (validation_log.jsonl complete)\n\n9b Assembly  (deterministic walk \u00b7 NO LLM per morning)\n   For each morning M \u2208 Days 6\u201335: walk every storyline plan.md, apply lifecycle effects\n   ordered by effective_from, consult validation_log, emit ideal_digests/morning_NN.json.\n   Pure temporal arithmetic over declarative ground truth.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Stage 9 SUBGRAPH  \u00b7  Ideal Digest  (validation + assembly merged)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n9a Validation  (parallel-per-moment fan-out \u00b7 ~80\u2013150 LLM agents per persona)\n   For each declared moment with final lifecycle == DECLARED and target_morning \u2208 Days 6\u201335,\n   spawn ONE validation agent reading artifacts visible by morning M + calendar snapshot(M-1)\n   + daily_state(M-1) + character_sketch + judgment. Each agent emits exactly one of:\n   validation_pass \u00b7 validation_fail \u00b7 validation_correct \u2192 internal/validation_log.jsonl\n\n                         \u2193  (validation_log.jsonl complete)\n\n9b Assembly  (deterministic walk \u00b7 NO LLM per morning)\n   For each morning M \u2208 Days 6\u201335: walk every storyline plan.md, apply lifecycle effects\n   ordered by effective_from, consult validation_log, emit ideal_digests/morning_NN.json.\n   Pure temporal arithmetic over declarative ground truth.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 9
    },
